<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ModMetaData>
  <name>武器基站：CE 特殊武器后坐力兼容</name>
  <author>WhiteGiverMa</author>
  <packageId>meidocho.weaponstation.cerecoilfix</packageId>
  <supportedVersions><li>1.7</li></supportedVersions>
  <modDependencies>
    <li>
      <packageId>brrainz.harmony</packageId>
      <displayName>Harmony</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/2009463077</steamWorkshopUrl>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>CETeam.CombatExtended</packageId>
      <displayName>Combat Extended</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/2890901044</steamWorkshopUrl>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>Vortex.WeaponStation</packageId>
      <displayName>Weapon Station</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/3807251471</steamWorkshopUrl>
    </li>
  </modDependencies>
  <loadAfter>
    <li>brrainz.harmony</li>
    <li>CETeam.CombatExtended</li>
    <li>Vortex.WeaponStation</li>
  </loadAfter>
  <description>修复武器基站安装侵蚀葫芦等保留原版射击类型的特殊武器后，CE 后坐力动画触发的类型转换异常。仅跳过这些武器在基站上的 CE 后坐力动画，保留普通 CE 枪械动画，不改射击、伤害、弹药、武器定义或存档。支持 RimWorld 1.7，可与「武器基站：左键选择安装武器」一起使用。</description>
</ModMetaData>
